{
  "id": "501",
  "title": "Do You Have a Charger?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-07-28",
  "synopsis": "Ben borrows Little Yu's power bank to charge his phone.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/749/7b90a766b949651c2597f96f58ff028e51a0c404.mp3?1574950828",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 5: You’re my best friend",
    "chapter": 19,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你有充电器吗？\n\n本：我手机快没电了，你有充电器吗？\n小雨：有。但是这里没有插座啊。\n本：这可怎么办！我在等丽丽的电话呢。\n小雨：啊，我有充电宝，可以用充电宝充电。\n本：它那么小，能有多少电？\n小雨：你别看它小，它可以给手机充好几次电呢！\n本：还有那么好的东西？回去我也要买一个！",
    "traditional": "你有充電器嗎？\n\n本：我手機快沒電了，你有充電器嗎？\n小雨：有。但是這裡沒有插座啊。\n本：這可怎麼辦！我在等麗麗的電話呢。\n小雨：啊，我有充電寶，可以用充電寶充電。\n本：它那麼小，能有多少電？\n小雨：你別看它小，它可以給手機充好幾次電呢！\n本：還有那麼好的東西？回去我也要買一個！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do You Have a Charger?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：我手机快没电了，你有充电器吗？",
      "traditional": "本：我手機快沒電了，你有充電器嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ shǒu jī kuài méi diàn le nǐ yǒu chōng diàn qì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: My phone is almost out of battery. Do you have a charger?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：有。但是这里没有插座啊。",
      "traditional": "小雨：有。但是這裡沒有插座啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ yǒu dàn shì zhè lǐ méi yǒu chā zuò a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Yes. But there's no power outlet here."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：这可怎么办！我在等丽丽的电话呢。",
      "traditional": "本：這可怎麼辦！我在等麗麗的電話呢。",
      "pinyin": "běn zhè kě zěn me bàn wǒ zài děng lì lì de diàn huà ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What should we do! I'm waiting for a call from Lili."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：啊，我有充电宝，可以用充电宝充电。",
      "traditional": "小雨：啊，我有充電寶，可以用充電寶充電。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ a wǒ yǒu chōng diàn bǎo kě yǐ yòng chōng diàn bǎo chōng diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ah, I have a power bank. You can use the power bank to charge."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：它那么小，能有多少电？",
      "traditional": "本：它那麼小，能有多少電？",
      "pinyin": "běn tā nà me xiǎo néng yǒu duō shao diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That tiny thing? How much can it charge?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小雨：你别看它小，它可以给手机充好几次电呢！",
      "traditional": "小雨：你別看它小，它可以給手機充好幾次電呢！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ bié kàn tā xiǎo tā kě yǐ gěi shǒu jī chōng hǎo jǐ cì diàn ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Don't judge it by its size. It can charge your phone several times!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：还有那么好的东西？回去我也要买一个！",
      "traditional": "本：還有那麼好的東西？回去我也要買一個！",
      "pinyin": "běn hái yǒu nà me hǎo de dōng xi huí qù wǒ yě yào mǎi yí ge",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: It's that convenient? I must buy one too when we get back!"
    }
  ],
